    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akalachilisibwa khukeisabato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Musa yakhung'aasia omukhung'aano kwosi kwabaana baIsiraeli, nabasunjila mbu Kano niko amakhuwa aka OMWAMI yalachilisiye, mbu mukakhole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emilimo chikholungwe tsindaalo tsisasaba; ne khunyanga yomusaafu mulabeetsanga nende inyanga inzahule, isabato yomuhongo yOMWAMI; omundu yesi oukhola omulimo kwosi khuyeneyo yeerwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Murahambia omulilo kwosi mubimenyo bieenywe khunyanga yeisabato ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omusololo kwOMWAMI",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa nasunjila omukhung'aano kwosi kwabaana baIsiraeli ari Lino nilio elia OMWAMI yalachilisiye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu Musolole abeene mwenyene omusololo kwOMWAMI; omundu yesi owomwoyo okuchama obuhaani, akuleere, omusololo okwo kwOMWAMI; itsahaabu, neifeetsa, nomukasa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nende tsingubo tsieibuluu, netsieisambarau, netsiranzayi, neikitani indorotoro isiire, nende obwoya bwetsimbusi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nende amaseelo kamamiiku akanyushilwa iranji iranzayi, namaseelo kandi amanyushe, nemisaala chiemipeeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nende amafura ketsitaha etsio, nemisaala chieshing'aari chiamafura akokhutsushiilila, khandi echiamalesi kelibuuliesi keisuuswa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amachina keishohamu, namachina kandi akokhureebwa khu ifoti eyo, nende khuloloti eyokhushilifu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ehichio bieshimenyo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne buli mundu omusitsa mwinywe yeetse, mukhole biosi ebia OMWAMI yalachilisiye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu eshimenyo, neliheema liashio, neshifuunikho shiashio, nebitiili biashio, nebitiisi biashio, netsisheti tsiashio, netsisiilo tsiashio, nende ebichibi biashio; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lisanduku, netsinyanzo tsialio, litisilo, nende ingubo ishinga yolwichi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "imeesa, netsinyanzo tsiayo, nebichio biayo biosi, nomukaate kwokhubaho khwanje; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eshichibi shietsitaha nashio khulwa tsitaha, nebikholelo biashio, netsitaha tsiashio, nende amafura ketsitaha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nende eshimalilo shiamalesi kelibuuliesi, netsinyanzo tsiashio, namafura akokhutsushiilila, namalesi kelibuuliesi keisuuswa, nolwichi, hamuliango weshimenyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eshimalilo shiemisango emisambe, nolukhanda lwashio lwomukasa, netsinyanzo tsiashio, nebikholelo biashio biosi, nolutaabo neshichibi shialwo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tsingubo tsinzeleesia tsiolwanyi, netsisiilo tsiatsio, nebichibi biatsio, nende olwichi Iweshilibwa shiolwanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebibambo bieshimenyo, nebibambo biolwanyi, nemikoye chiabio; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebiifwalo ebilukhwa bulayi, khulwa okhukhalabanila habundu ahaahule, nibio ebiifwalo ebiahule biaHaruni omukuhani, nebiifwalo biabaanabe, ebiokhukhalabanila mubukuhani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abandu baleera ebiomusololo kwOMWAMI",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omukhung'aano kwosi kwabaana baIsiraeli barula ewa Musa yali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibeetsa, buli mundu owa omwoyokwe kwamubuusia, khandi buli mundu owa rohoye yachila nachama, nibaleera omusololo kwOMWAMI, khulwa emilimo chieliheema liokhwakaana, khandi khulwa obukhalabani bwalio, khandi khulwa ebiifwalo ebiahule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibeetsa, kata abasaatsa kata abakhasi bosi aba emioyo chiabwe chiachama, nibaleera ebitiili, netsingaka tsiomumarwi, netsingaka tsieshibalikho, nebichechele, ebimili biosi bieitsahaabu; mbu buli mundu owayinia eshihaanwa ShiOMWAMI ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne buli mundu owalola mbu ali nende tsingubo tsieibuluu, netsieisambarau netsiranzayi, neikitani indorotoro, nobwoya bwetsimbusi, namaseelo kamamiiku akanyushilwa iranji iranzayi, namaseelo baadi amanyushe, nibabileera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli muluh owayinia omusololo kweifeetsa kata uy yaleera omusololo kwOMWAMI; khandi buli mundu owalola mbu ali nende omusaala kwomupeeli khulwa omulimo kwosi kwobukhalabani obwo, yakuleera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakhasi nabo abali abasitsa nibasiira namakhono kabwe, nibaleera obwa bali nibasiirile, mbu obuusi bweibuluu, nobweisambarau, noburanzayi, nende ikitani indorotoro isiile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakhasi bosi aba emioyo chiabwe chiababuusia mubusitsa nibasiila obwoya bwetsimbusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeemilisi nabo nibaleera amachina ako keishohamu, namachina kandi akokhureebwa khu ifoti eyo nende khuloloti eyokhushilifu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nemisaala chieshing'aari, nende amafura; khulwa tsitaha, khandi khulwa amafura akokhutsushiilila, khandi khulwa amalesi kelibuuliesi keisuuswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana baIsiraeli baleerela OMWAMI eshihaanwa shiokhuchama khwemioyo chiabwe; buli mundu omusaatsa kata omukhasi, owa omwoyokwe kwachila nachama okhuleera ebiemilimo chiosi echia OMWAMI yali nalachile chikholelwe mumukhono kwaMusa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
